OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start, with isolated
OL,6,Fshowers. Cloud breaks developing and
OL,7,Fshowers tending to ease to leave an
OL,8,Foften dry afternoon with some bright
OL,9,Fintervals. A brisk breeze persisting,
OL,10,Fespecially around the coast.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable cloud could give an
OL,14,Fisolated shower, although often dry.
OL,15,FPatchy hill fog on the higher
OL,16,FDerbyshire hills. Chilly where any
OL,17,Fcloud breaks persist but generally
OL,18,Ffrost-free.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
